sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Reconciler as MCPServerReconciler<br/>controller-runtime
    participant HandshakeClient as MCP Handshake Client<br/>go-sdk
    participant MCPPod as MCP Server Pod<br/>dynamic port HTTP
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus Scraper
    participant Metrics as Metrics Server<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,MCPPod: Flow 1: MCPServer Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply MCPServer CR<br/>mcp.x-k8s.io/v1alpha1
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Watch event: MCPServer created/updated<br/>ServiceAccount token auth

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Get referenced ConfigMaps & Secrets<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: ConfigMap/Secret data

    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Compute configuration hash<br/>for rolling updates

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Deployment created

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Service created

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicy<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: NetworkPolicy created

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Check Deployment availability<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Deployment available

    Note over HandshakeClient,MCPPod: MCP Protocol Handshake (exponential backoff: 10s, 20s, 40s, 80s)

    Reconciler->>HandshakeClient: Initiate MCP handshake
    HandshakeClient->>MCPPod: POST initialize request<br/>HTTP (in-cluster, no auth)
    MCPPod-->>HandshakeClient: MCP initialize response<br/>capabilities: tools, resources, prompts
    HandshakeClient-->>Reconciler: Server capabilities extracted

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update MCPServer status<br/>capabilities, conditions
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Status updated

    Note over Prometheus,Metrics: Flow 2: Metrics Collection

    Prometheus->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443 TLS (self-signed)
    Metrics->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>Verify scraper identity
    K8sAPI-->>Metrics: Authorized
    Metrics-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics response
